    "seo tools comparison",
    "compare seo software",
    "seo software comparison"
   ],
   "owner": "/category/seo/",
   "support": [
    "/best/best-seo-tools/"
   ],
   "note": "2026-11-11 GSC: hub ranks better for comparison queries (23.5 vs 33; 47.7 vs 58). \"best seo tools\" stays with the guide."
  }
 ],
